{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“紧合几何态射”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"紧合几何态射"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>称意象 $\\mathcal C$ 为紧意象是指"},{"Local":{"url":"整体截面","text":"整体截面"}},{"Plain":"的直像部分保持"},{"Local":{"url":"子终对象","text":"子终对象"}},{"Plain":"的定向并.</p>\n<p>称"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"态射 $f\\colon \\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为紧合的, 是指其为 $\\mathcal E$ 上的紧意象. 这个条件可用"},{"Local":{"url":"叠语义","text":"叠语义"}},{"Plain":"表述.</p>\n"}]}}